  {"en":"to take, to catch (coger)","topic":"careful","words":[{"es":"coger","where":"fine in Cuba, Puerto Rico, Dominican Republic, Colombia, Spain"},{"es":"tomar, agarrar","where":"use these in Mexico, Argentina and much of Central America"}],"note":"Coger is a vulgar word for sex in Mexico, Argentina and parts of Central America."},
